Sval: Remove Report Broken Site

Reports go to webcompat.com, a Mozilla service (spec §10.9). The reporter
goes whole: both components, the toolkit actor, the Help menu item, the
app menu and protections panel buttons, its panel, command, strings,
styles, prefs, Nimbus feature and Glean metrics.

